  <div data-target-figure="fig3" data-hint-control="fig3-p"><strong>Fisher information</strong>The model's local sensitivity to the parameter.</div>
  <div data-target-figure="fig4" data-hint-control="fig4-transform"><strong>Jeffreys prior</strong>The prior density proportional to $\sqrt&#123;I(\theta)&#125;$, invariant under smooth reparameterization.</div>
  <div data-target-figure="fig5"><strong>MLE</strong>The likelihood maximizer, recovered as posterior mode in large samples under mild priors.</div>
</div>

